  description: Having damaged her memory from the legendary battle against the gods,
    rumour has it that Fennia was saved by a mysterious hammer wielding warrior,
    unlocking her hidden talents which re-ignited her lightning prowess from its
    slumber. Being the ever happy-go-lucky maiden, she was determined to recollect
    her lost memories as old friends were found and new ones were forged.
